{"id":"arc","lemma":"arc","pos":"noun","rank":3673,"glosses":["bow (weapon)","arc (curve)","arc, circular arc, circle segment"],"ipa":"/aʁk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/Fr-arc.ogg/Fr-arc.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"arcs"},"formAudio":{"arcs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-arcs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Un arc est inutile sans flèches.","en":"A bow is no use without arrows.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"useless"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"arrow","l":"flèche"}]},{"text":"Avez-vous vu l'arc-en-ciel ce matin?","en":"Did you see the rainbow this morning?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"morning"}]},{"text":"Un arc-en-ciel est un phénomène naturel.","en":"A rainbow is a natural phenomenon.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"phenomenon"},{"g":"natural"}]},{"text":"Je n'ai jamais vu d'arc-en-ciel.","en":"I've never seen a rainbow.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"sky"}]},{"text":"Quel bel arc-en-ciel !","en":"What a beautiful rainbow!","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"bel"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"sky"}]}]}